		{
			dependencies: ["5F4AB8898713F70B"]
			description: [
				"&3High Pressure Boilers&r will be a better source of Steam for powering your Steam machines."
				""
				"Keep in mind that you will still be using Steam to power your Electric machines in &7LV&r via the miracles of energy conversion."
				""
				"&cNote:&r You will need more than a handful of &3HP Boilers&r. The more you make, the less you'll need to worry about running out of power."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The &3Solid Boiler&r burns solid Fuel. It's self explanatory - better fuels last longer."
				""
				"The &3Liquid Boiler&r burns either &dLava&r or &dCreosote&r."
				""
				"The &3Solar Boiler&r burns nothing - it's fueled by the sun."
				""
				"Looking for a recommendation? Honestly, either goes, as all three boilers are equivalent in generation. Craft the boiler that best suits your preferred resource."
				""
				"Get &eany&r of the proposed boilers to complete this quest."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:hp_steam_solid_boiler"
			id: "526E7341A40F3919"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 12
					id: "29EA602FB911BCCC"
					item: "minecraft:iron_ingot"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
